Web Scraping and Data Analytics

A Python-based web scraping project designed to automate data collection, extract useful information from websites, clean and transform raw data, and store structured datasets for further analysis and visualization.

System Architecture
           Target Websites
                  |
                  v
           Data Collection
       (Requests / Selenium)
                  |
                  v
          HTML Data Parsing
           (BeautifulSoup)
                  |
                  v
       Data Cleaning & Validation
               (Pandas)
                  |
                  v
             Data Storage
        (CSV / SQLite / SQL)
                  |
                  v
        Analysis & Visualization
       (Python / SQL / Power BI)
Technology Stack
Python: Core programming language
Requests: Web page retrieval
BeautifulSoup: HTML parsing and data extraction
Selenium: Dynamic web page scraping
Pandas: Data cleaning and transformation
SQLite / CSV: Data storage
Power BI: Data visualization
