Workflow
Collect publicly available data from target websites.
Parse HTML and extract the required information.
Clean and validate the collected data.
Store structured data in CSV files or a database.
Analyze the dataset and generate meaningful insights.
Visualize the results using dashboards.
Installation

Clone the repository and install the required dependencies.

git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Web-Scraping.git
cd Web-Scraping
pip install -r requirements.txt
Usage

Run the main Python script:

python main.py
